flowchart TB
    R["Request for environment, project, pipeline and playbook"] --> K{"Existing claim?"}
    K -->|No| C["Persist claim before execution"]
    C --> D["Execute and record result"]
    K -->|Yes| S{"Original outcome?"}
    S -->|Completed| P["Replay exit code and export original artifacts"]
    S -->|Proven pre-submit refusal| A["Retry admission"]
    A --> C
    S -->|Unresolved| H["Refuse another execution"]
    H --> F["Collect original UUID or reconcile on controller"]
